      "data_structures": "DRAFT (mock, grounded on 8 retrieved chunks):\n- ID | Type | Requirement IR-0101 | interface | The ground segment interface shall transmit telemetry sample envelopes as defined in api.proto (message TelemetrySample). IR-0102 | interface | The acquisition command interface shall accept a StartCommand message to begin acquisition. IR-0103 | interface | The health reporting interface shall expose an MTBF estimate as defined in api.proto (message HealthReport). IR-0104 | interface | The sensor interface shall provide a raw sample stream at the con  [source: IRS_v2.0.docx / 3. Interface Requirements]\n- Interface Requirements Specification (IRS) Revision 2.0 \u2014 interface requirements for the ground segment and sensor interfaces.  [source: IRS_v2.0.docx / IRS_v2.0.docx]\n- syntax = \"proto3\"; package telemetry_acq; // Telemetry sample envelope (interface IR-0101). message TelemetrySample { uint32 channel = 1; double timestamp = 2; repeated double values = 3; } // Command message to start acquisition (interface IR-0102). message StartCommand { uint32 num_channels = 1; uint32 sample_rate_hz = 2; } // Health status report (interface IR-0103). message HealthReport { string status = 1; double mtbf_estimate_hours = 2; }  [source: /home/hanuai/Documents/sdlc-docgen/backend/storage/ec0b5cea-6bd5-47d6-ad58-7e95b7930a98/uploads/code/telemetry_acq/api.proto / /home/hanuai/Documents/sdlc-docgen/backend/storage/ec0b5cea-6bd5-47d6-ad58-7e95b7930a98/uploads/code/telemetry_acq/api.proto]\n- art(self) -> None: self._running = True for channel in range(self.num_channels): thread = threading.Thread(target=self._acquire, args=(channel,), daemon=True) thread.start() self._threads.append(thread) def _acquire(self, channel: int) -> None: while self._running: sample = Sample(channel=channel, timestamp=time.time(), values=[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]) self._queue.put(sample) time.sleep(1.0 / self.sample_rate_hz) def read(self, timeout_s: float = 1.0) -> list[Sample]: samples: list[Sample] = [] for _ in   [source: /home/hanuai/Documents/sdlc-docgen/backend/storage/ec0b5cea-6bd5-47d6-ad58-7e95b7930a98/uploads/code/telemetry_acq/acquisition.py / /home/hanuai/Documents/sdlc-docgen/backend/storage/ec0b5cea-6bd5-47d6-ad58-7e95b7930a98/uploads/code/telemetry_acq/acquisition.py]\n- elf._running = False for thread in self._threads: thread.join(timeout=1.0)  [source: /home/hanuai/Documents/sdlc-docgen/backend/storage/ec0b5cea-6bd5-47d6-ad58-7e95b7930a98/uploads/code/telemetry_acq/acquisition.py / /home/hanuai/Documents/sdlc-docgen/backend/storage/ec0b5cea-6bd5-47d6-ad58-7e95b7930a98/uploads/code/telemetry_acq/acquisition.py]"
